# Ability catalog discipline

Deepen the module `catalog()` (or equivalent). Derive `names` / `write` / `hitl` / progress / summary from it — do not hand-sync sibling arrays.

Ship or silence: name an ability in prompts, playbooks, or error copy only when it is registered and executable on that path.

When adding or changing an ability, complete [`docs/agents/ability-checklist.md`](../../docs/agents/ability-checklist.md) and keep `*AbilityCatalogTest` + `PhantomAbilityNameTest` green.
